<% @title = "You're invited to #{@event_name}" %>

<h2>Hi <%= @user.full_name %>, you’ve been added to an event!</h2>

<p><strong><%= @event_name %></strong> is happening on <%= @event_date %>.</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @event_url %>">See the event details</a>
</p>

<p>Head over to HappenHub to chat with attendees and stay in the loop.</p>
